+# Hosts a source named by the review model may be on: the forges and package hosts above. Any other host (a
+# look-alike of one of these included) offers no button, so the model cannot make the card name a stranger.
+_JUDGE_HOSTS = _GITHUB_HOSTS | _FORGE_HOSTS | frozenset(_PROJECT_HOSTS) | frozenset({"gist.github.com"})
+_JUDGE_BAD = re.compile(r"[\s*?\[\]{}<>$`|;&\\,\"'^]")
